cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agentic Admission: A multi-agent LLM panel for MTE dossier evaluation at EPFL"
abstract: >-
  A decision-support system that emulates the EPFL Master in Management,
  Technology and Entrepreneurship (MTE) admission committee using a panel of
  four specialist LLM evaluators and a Chair. Calibrated against six years of
  historical committee verdicts on 1,342 candidates (2020-2026). Reaches 82%
  agreement with the committee on the 28 EPFL-internal candidates of Spring
  2025-26 after a documented three-band GPA rule, with 5-run majority-vote
  stability of 76.6% on the full 128-candidate cohort.
